talk.opt.sell_yes=Sold for ${price}
talk.opt.sell_no=No, he stays with me
talk.opt.sell_no.f=No, she stays with me
talk.train_item={skill} {from}–{to}
talk.hello.papers=Papers are in order, mister. With a pedigree like that you could show him in Saint Denis. Anything else for him?
talk.hello.papers.f=Papers are in order, mister. With a pedigree like that you could show her in Saint Denis. Anything else for her?
talk.hello.nopapers=Good dog, mister, but without papers a buyer sees a stray. What can I do for him?
talk.hello.nopapers.f=Good dog, mister, but without papers a buyer sees a stray. What can I do for her?
talk.hello.ailing=He don't look well, mister. I'd have the doctor see him before it's too late.
talk.hello.ailing.f=She don't look well, mister. I'd have the doctor see her before it's too late.
talk.hello.nodog=Dogs are out in the yard, mister, every one with papers. Have a look.
talk.say.train=What should he learn? The stable hand works with him a day and he comes back sharp.
talk.say.train.f=What should she learn? The stable hand works with her a day and she comes back sharp.
talk.say.sale={grade} {breed}, mister. Yours for ${price}, papers and all.
talk.say.sale.f={grade} {breed}, mister. Yours for ${price}, papers and all.
talk.say.sell=I'll give you ${price} for him, mister. Fair price with papers.
talk.say.sell.f=I'll give you ${price} for her, mister. Fair price with papers.
talk.say.sell_nopapers=Without papers I can't go over ${price} for him, mister.
talk.say.sell_nopapers.f=Without papers I can't go over ${price} for her, mister.
talk.say.bring=Which of yours should I fetch? Five dollars and it's here in a quarter minute.
talk.no_money=That's short, mister. Come back when you're flush.
talk.done.away=The stable hand's taking {name} now. Pick him up when he's ready.
talk.done.away.f=The stable hand's taking {name} now. Pick her up when she's ready.
talk.done.papers=Done, mister. He's all legal now.
talk.done.papers.f=Done, mister. She's all legal now.
talk.done.sold=Deal. Don't fret over {name}, I'll find him a good home.
talk.done.sold.f=Deal. Don't fret over {name}, I'll find her a good home.
talk.done.bring={name} will be right here, mister.
talk.done.bought=He's yours, mister. I've made out the papers.
talk.done.bought.f=She's yours, mister. I've made out the papers.
help.horse_pelts_full=The horse already carries three pelts — no room for more, the pelt lies beside it
